==Trivia==
[[File:Tower duo perching Evolutions.png|thumb|200px|The [[Tower duo]] depicted perching]]
*This is the first animated media to be scored by [[Ed Goldfarb]] in all languages.
*Much like in [[Pokémon Origins]], [[Pokémon Generations]], and [[Pokémon: Twilight Wings]], all Pokémon seen in Evolutions make realistic animal sounds instead of just saying their names, like in the [[Pokémon animated series|TV series]].
*Each episode features two {{p|Pikachu}} wearing the hats of the [[player character]]s of the region they feature in.
*''[[PE07|The Show]]'' is the first time in any media that {{p|Lugia}} is depicted perching on the [[Burned Tower|Brass Tower]].

